            "value" : "ทัชแพดไม่ต้องปรับเทียบแล้ว จึงนำปรับเทียบทัชแพดออก macOS รายงานทั้งแผ่น"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dokunmatik yüzeyin kalibrasyona ihtiyacı yok, bu yüzden Dokunmatik Yüzeyi Kalibre Et kaldırıldı: macOS yüzeyin tamamını bildirir"
